(setter_zero -- restore Z zero after a tool change)

(Probes the setter with the newly clamped tool and sets work Z zero so that)
(the trigger point reads D. Requires a calibration from setter_cal for the)
(workpiece currently on the table; aborts if none is marked valid.)

o<setter_zero> sub

  o110 if [#5381 NE 1]
    (abort, setter_zero: no calibration for this setup, run o<setter_cal> call while Z zero is still good)
  o110 endif

  M70

  o<setter_probe> call

  G10 L20 P0 Z#5383

  (debug, Z zero restored from setter: D = #5383)

  G53 G0 Z#<_ini[TOOLSENSOR]SAFE_Z>

  M72

o<setter_zero> endsub
